<title>UK: BSkyB to launch National Geographic channel.</title>
<headline>BSkyB to launch National Geographic channel.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Sky Broadcasting said on Tuesday that it has agreed with the National Geographic Channel to launch a National Geographic channel in the UK and Ireland this summer.</p>
<p>BSkyB said in a statement that the channel will be offered to subscribers as part of its Multi-Channels package.</p>
<p>National Geographic announced last year that it would launch a National Geographic cable television channel with General Electric Co's National Broadcasting Co unit.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
